@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = <paste token here>

### Audio transcribe (WebM upload example)
# Works with browser-recorded audio in WebM/Opus format.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audio/transcribe
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="store_id"

store-001
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="speaker_role"

customer
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="conversation_id"

conv-1001
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="customer-clip.webm"
Content-Type: audio/webm

< ./sample-customer.webm
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Opportunities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/opportunities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Review opportunity
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/opportunities/opp-2002
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CONVERTED",
  "manager_note": "Follow-up confirmed by manager."
}

### Sales intelligence
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sales-intelligence
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reports daily
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/daily
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reports weekly
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/weekly
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reports monthly
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/monthly
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POS transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pos/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create demo POS transaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pos/demo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POS webhook sample
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/pos/webhook
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "store_id": "store-001",
  "employee_id": "employee-001",
  "sku": "CHG-USBC",
  "name": "USB-C Charger",
  "amount": 19.99
}

### Analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
